WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.627
No small semidefinite program for matching.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.709
Linear programs for perfect matching were known

3
00:00:05.709 --> 00:00:08.217
to be huge. What about semidefinite ones?

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.256
A small one would give a short proof for an impossible puzzle.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.827
Claimed: any exact one has exponential size.

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.984
Lean checks only part.
